    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Supported chains: BNB, Arbitrum, Polygon, Ethereum, Base<br />\nSupported tokens: USDC, USDT, USDe<br />\nBinance Pay supported</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install via the <strong>WordPress Plugin Installer</strong> or upload manually.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin under <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Installed Plugins</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://dashboard.zenobank.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">dashboard.zenobank.io</a> and create your account.  </li>\n<li>Add a wallet address or connect your <strong>Binance Pay API</strong> (this is where you’ll receive funds).  </li>\n<li>In your dashboard, go to <strong>Integrations <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> WooCommerce</strong>, and click <strong>Connect</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Copy the generated <strong>API key</strong>.  </li>\n<li>In your WordPress store, open the <strong>Zeno Crypto Payment Gateway</strong> settings and paste the API key.  </li>\n<li>Save changes, enable the gateway, and start accepting crypto payments.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated readme.txt (improved plugin description and formatting).</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
